+ * Framebuffer text console.  The board has no UART and the eMMC console cannot be read while the
+ * system runs, so the kernel log is also drawn on screen.  The address comes from the kernel's
+ * own vinfo, the same source the panic screen uses, because a plain physical write faults: the
+ * page is not mapped for pexpert or for a driver.
